{
  "book": "2nephi",
  "bookName": "2 Nephi",
  "chapter": 25,
  "voice": {
    "provider": "elevenlabs",
    "voice_id": "ddDFRErfhdc2asyySOG5",
    "model_id": "eleven_multilingual_v2",
    "settings": {
      "stability": 0.5,
      "similarity_boost": 0.75,
      "style": 0.35,
      "use_speaker_boost": true
    },
    "name": "Samuel"
  },
  "pauses": {
    "line_ms": 180,
    "verse_ms": 500
  },
  "duration": 630.766,
  "lines": [
    {
      "start": 0.0,
      "end": 2.276,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Now I, Nephi, do speak somewhat",
      "verse": "25:1",
      "lineIndex": 1
    },
    {
      "start": 2.456,
      "end": 5.057,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "concerning the words which I have written,",
      "verse": "25:1",
      "lineIndex": 2
    },
    {
      "start": 5.237,
      "end": 8.116,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "which have been spoken by the mouth of Isaiah.",
      "verse": "25:1",
      "lineIndex": 3
    },
    {
      "start": 8.296,
      "end": 11.036,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "For behold, Isaiah spake many things",
      "verse": "25:1",
      "lineIndex": 4
    },
    {
      "start": 11.216,
      "end": 14.42,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "which were hard for many of my people to understand;",
      "verse": "25:1",
      "lineIndex": 5
    },
    {
      "start": 14.6,
      "end": 18.547,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "for they know not concerning the manner of prophesying among the Jews.",
      "verse": "25:1",
      "lineIndex": 6
    },
    {
      "start": 19.227,
      "end": 22.153,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "For I, Nephi, have not taught them many things",
      "verse": "25:2",
      "lineIndex": 7
    },
    {
      "start": 22.333,
      "end": 24.562,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "concerning the manner of the Jews;",
      "verse": "25:2",
      "lineIndex": 8
    },
    {
      "start": 24.742,
      "end": 27.343,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "for their works were works of darkness,",
      "verse": "25:2",
      "lineIndex": 9
    },
    {
      "start": 27.523,
      "end": 30.634,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and their doings were doings of abominations.",
      "verse": "25:2",
      "lineIndex": 10
    },
    {
      "start": 31.314,
      "end": 33.682,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Wherefore, I write unto my people,",
      "verse": "25:3",
      "lineIndex": 12
    },
    {
      "start": 33.862,
      "end": 36.927,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "unto all those that shall receive hereafter",
      "verse": "25:3",
      "lineIndex": 13
    },
    {
      "start": 37.107,
      "end": 41.705,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "these things which I write, that they may know the judgments of God,",
      "verse": "25:3",
      "lineIndex": 14
    },
    {
      "start": 41.885,
      "end": 46.668,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "that they come upon all nations, according to the word which he hath spoken.",
      "verse": "25:3",
      "lineIndex": 15
    },
    {
      "start": 47.348,
      "end": 49.438,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Wherefore, hearken, O my people,",
      "verse": "25:4",
      "lineIndex": 16
    },
    {
      "start": 49.618,
      "end": 52.219,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "which are of the house of Israel,",
      "verse": "25:4",
      "lineIndex": 17
    },
    {
      "start": 52.399,
      "end": 54.349,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and give ear unto my words;",
      "verse": "25:4",
      "lineIndex": 18
    },
    {
      "start": 54.529,
      "end": 57.826,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "for because the words of Isaiah are not plain unto you,",
      "verse": "25:4",
      "lineIndex": 19
    },
    {
      "start": 58.006,
      "end": 62.743,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "nevertheless they are plain unto all those that are filled with the spirit of prophecy.",
      "verse": "25:4",
      "lineIndex": 20
    },
    {
      "start": 62.923,
      "end": 68.124,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "But I give unto you a prophecy, according to the spirit which is in me;",
      "verse": "25:4",
      "lineIndex": 21
    },
    {
      "start": 68.304,
      "end": 73.134,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "wherefore I shall prophesy according to the plainness which hath been with me",
      "verse": "25:4",
      "lineIndex": 22
    },
    {
      "start": 73.314,
      "end": 77.447,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "from the time that I came out from Jerusalem with my father;",
      "verse": "25:4",
      "lineIndex": 23
    },
    {
      "start": 77.627,
      "end": 81.296,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "for behold, my soul delighteth in plainness unto my people,",
      "verse": "25:4",
      "lineIndex": 24
    },
    {
      "start": 81.476,
      "end": 83.055,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "that they may learn.",
      "verse": "25:4",
      "lineIndex": 25
    },
    {
      "start": 83.735,
      "end": 86.986,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Yea, and my soul delighteth in the words of Isaiah,",
      "verse": "25:5",
      "lineIndex": 26
    },
    {
      "start": 87.166,
      "end": 89.395,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "for I came out from Jerusalem,",
      "verse": "25:5",
      "lineIndex": 27
    },
    {
      "start": 89.575,
      "end": 92.965,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and mine eyes hath beheld the things of the Jews,",
      "verse": "25:5",
      "lineIndex": 28
    },
    {
      "start": 93.145,
      "end": 97.185,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and I know that the Jews do understand the things of the prophets,",
      "verse": "25:5",
      "lineIndex": 29
    },
    {
      "start": 97.365,
      "end": 102.288,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and there is none other people that understand the things which were spoken unto the Jews",
      "verse": "25:5",
      "lineIndex": 30
    },
    {
      "start": 102.468,
      "end": 103.815,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "like unto them,",
      "verse": "25:5",
      "lineIndex": 31
    },
    {
      "start": 103.995,
      "end": 108.593,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "save it be that they are taught after the manner of the things of the Jews.",
      "verse": "25:5",
      "lineIndex": 32
    },
    {
      "start": 109.273,
      "end": 114.567,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "But behold, I, Nephi, have not taught my children after the manner of the Jews;",
      "verse": "25:6",
      "lineIndex": 33
    },
    {
      "start": 114.747,
      "end": 118.369,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "but behold, I, of myself, have dwelt at Jerusalem,",
      "verse": "25:6",
      "lineIndex": 34
    },
    {
      "start": 118.549,
      "end": 122.078,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "wherefore I know concerning the regions round about;",
      "verse": "25:6",
      "lineIndex": 35
    },
    {
      "start": 122.258,
      "end": 126.902,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and I have made mention unto my children concerning the judgments of God,",
      "verse": "25:6",
      "lineIndex": 36
    },
    {
      "start": 127.082,
      "end": 133.909,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "which hath come to pass among the Jews, unto my children, according to all that which Isaiah hath spoken,",
      "verse": "25:6",
      "lineIndex": 37
    },
    {
      "start": 134.089,
      "end": 135.761,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and I do not write them.",
      "verse": "25:6",
      "lineIndex": 38
    },
    {
      "start": 136.441,
      "end": 141.039,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "But behold, I proceed with mine own prophecy, according to my plainness;",
      "verse": "25:7",
      "lineIndex": 39
    },
    {
      "start": 141.219,
      "end": 144.005,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "in the which I know that no man can err;",
      "verse": "25:7",
      "lineIndex": 40
    },
    {
      "start": 144.185,
      "end": 148.783,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "nevertheless, in the days that the prophecies of Isaiah shall be fulfilled",
      "verse": "25:7",
      "lineIndex": 41
    },
    {
      "start": 148.963,
      "end": 151.285,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "men shall know of a surety,",
      "verse": "25:7",
      "lineIndex": 42
    },
    {
      "start": 151.465,
      "end": 153.88,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "at the times when they shall come to pass.",
      "verse": "25:7",
      "lineIndex": 43
    },
    {
      "start": 154.56,
      "end": 157.857,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Wherefore, they are of worth unto the children of men,",
      "verse": "25:8",
      "lineIndex": 45
    },
    {
      "start": 158.037,
      "end": 160.173,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and he that supposeth that they are not,",
      "verse": "25:8",
      "lineIndex": 46
    },
    {
      "start": 160.353,
      "end": 162.768,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "unto them will I speak particularly,",
      "verse": "25:8",
      "lineIndex": 47
    },
    {
      "start": 162.948,
      "end": 166.106,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and confine the words unto mine own people;",
      "verse": "25:8",
      "lineIndex": 48
    },
    {
      "start": 166.286,
      "end": 170.698,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "for I know that they shall be of great worth unto them in the last days;",
      "verse": "25:8",
      "lineIndex": 49
    },
    {
      "start": 170.878,
      "end": 173.664,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "for in that day shall they understand them;",
      "verse": "25:8",
      "lineIndex": 50
    },
    {
      "start": 173.844,
      "end": 176.491,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "wherefore, for their good have I written them.",
      "verse": "25:8",
      "lineIndex": 51
    },
    {
      "start": 177.171,
      "end": 181.954,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And as one generation hath been destroyed among the Jews because of iniquity,",
      "verse": "25:9",
      "lineIndex": 52
    },
    {
      "start": 182.134,
      "end": 187.057,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "even so have they been destroyed from generation to generation according to their iniquities;",
      "verse": "25:9",
      "lineIndex": 53
    },
    {
      "start": 187.237,
      "end": 189.884,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and never hath any of them been destroyed",
      "verse": "25:9",
      "lineIndex": 54
    },
    {
      "start": 190.064,
      "end": 193.222,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "save it were foretold them by the prophets of the Lord.",
      "verse": "25:9",
      "lineIndex": 55
    },
    {
      "start": 193.902,
      "end": 199.8,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Wherefore, it hath been told them concerning the destruction which should come upon them,",
      "verse": "25:10",
      "lineIndex": 56
    },
    {
      "start": 199.98,
      "end": 202.766,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "immediately after my father left Jerusalem;",
      "verse": "25:10",
      "lineIndex": 57
    },
    {
      "start": 202.946,
      "end": 205.407,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "nevertheless, they hardened their hearts;",
      "verse": "25:10",
      "lineIndex": 58
    },
    {
      "start": 205.587,
      "end": 208.791,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and according to my prophecy they have been destroyed,",
      "verse": "25:10",
      "lineIndex": 59
    },
    {
      "start": 208.971,
      "end": 212.593,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "save it be those which are carried away captive into Babylon.",
      "verse": "25:10",
      "lineIndex": 60
    },
    {
      "start": 213.273,
      "end": 216.477,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And now this I speak because of the spirit which is in me.",
      "verse": "25:11",
      "lineIndex": 61
    },
    {
      "start": 216.657,
      "end": 219.118,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And notwithstanding they have been carried away",
      "verse": "25:11",
      "lineIndex": 62
    },
    {
      "start": 219.298,
      "end": 221.016,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "they shall return again,",
      "verse": "25:11",
      "lineIndex": 63
    },
    {
      "start": 221.196,
      "end": 223.472,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and possess the land of Jerusalem;",
      "verse": "25:11",
      "lineIndex": 64
    },
    {
      "start": 223.652,
      "end": 228.064,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "wherefore, they shall be restored again to the land of their inheritance.",
      "verse": "25:11",
      "lineIndex": 65
    },
    {
      "start": 228.744,
      "end": 232.738,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "But, behold, they shall have wars, and rumors of wars;",
      "verse": "25:12",
      "lineIndex": 66
    },
    {
      "start": 232.918,
      "end": 237.098,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and when the day cometh that the Only Begotten of the Father,",
      "verse": "25:12",
      "lineIndex": 67
    },
    {
      "start": 237.278,
      "end": 243.594,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "yea, even the Father of heaven and of earth, shall manifest himself unto them in the flesh,",
      "verse": "25:12",
      "lineIndex": 68
    },
    {
      "start": 243.774,
      "end": 247.396,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "behold, they will reject him, because of their iniquities,",
      "verse": "25:12",
      "lineIndex": 69
    },
    {
      "start": 247.576,
      "end": 249.619,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and the hardness of their hearts,",
      "verse": "25:12",
      "lineIndex": 70
    },
    {
      "start": 249.799,
      "end": 252.121,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and the stiffness of their necks.",
      "verse": "25:12",
      "lineIndex": 71
    },
    {
      "start": 252.801,
      "end": 254.984,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Behold, they will crucify him;",
      "verse": "25:13",
      "lineIndex": 72
    },
    {
      "start": 255.164,
      "end": 258.926,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and after he is laid in a sepulchre for the space of three days",
      "verse": "25:13",
      "lineIndex": 73
    },
    {
      "start": 259.106,
      "end": 262.403,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "he shall rise from the dead, with healing in his wings;",
      "verse": "25:13",
      "lineIndex": 74
    },
    {
      "start": 262.583,
      "end": 267.273,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and all those who shall believe on his name shall be saved in the kingdom of God.",
      "verse": "25:13",
      "lineIndex": 75
    },
    {
      "start": 267.453,
      "end": 271.493,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Wherefore, my soul delighteth to prophesy concerning him,",
      "verse": "25:13",
      "lineIndex": 76
    },
    {
      "start": 271.673,
      "end": 273.484,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "for I have seen his day,",
      "verse": "25:13",
      "lineIndex": 77
    },
    {
      "start": 273.664,
      "end": 276.218,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and my heart doth magnify his holy name.",
      "verse": "25:13",
      "lineIndex": 78
    },
    {
      "start": 276.898,
      "end": 279.127,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And behold it shall come to pass",
      "verse": "25:14",
      "lineIndex": 79
    },
    {
      "start": 279.307,
      "end": 282.093,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "after the Messiah hath risen from the dead,",
      "verse": "25:14",
      "lineIndex": 80
    },
    {
      "start": 282.273,
      "end": 285.013,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and hath manifested himself unto his people,",
      "verse": "25:14",
      "lineIndex": 81
    },
    {
      "start": 285.193,
      "end": 287.515,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "unto as many as will believe on his name,",
      "verse": "25:14",
      "lineIndex": 82
    },
    {
      "start": 287.695,
      "end": 290.481,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "behold, Jerusalem shall be destroyed again;",
      "verse": "25:14",
      "lineIndex": 83
    },
    {
      "start": 290.661,
      "end": 295.119,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "for wo unto them that fight against God and the people of his church.",
      "verse": "25:14",
      "lineIndex": 84
    },
    {
      "start": 295.799,
      "end": 299.375,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Wherefore, the Jews shall be scattered among all nations;",
      "verse": "25:15",
      "lineIndex": 85
    },
    {
      "start": 299.555,
      "end": 302.249,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "yea, and also Babylon shall be destroyed;",
      "verse": "25:15",
      "lineIndex": 86
    },
    {
      "start": 302.429,
      "end": 306.005,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "wherefore, the Jews shall be scattered by other nations.",
      "verse": "25:15",
      "lineIndex": 87
    },
    {
      "start": 306.685,
      "end": 308.821,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And after they have been scattered,",
      "verse": "25:16",
      "lineIndex": 89
    },
    {
      "start": 309.001,
      "end": 317.546,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and the Lord God hath scourged them by other nations for the space of many generations, yea, even down from generation to generation",
      "verse": "25:16",
      "lineIndex": 90
    },
    {
      "start": 317.726,
      "end": 321.627,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "until they shall be persuaded to believe in Christ, the Son of God,",
      "verse": "25:16",
      "lineIndex": 91
    },
    {
      "start": 321.807,
      "end": 325.151,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and the atonement, which is infinite for all mankind\u2014",
      "verse": "25:16",
      "lineIndex": 92
    },
    {
      "start": 325.331,
      "end": 328.86,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and when that day shall come that they shall believe in Christ,",
      "verse": "25:16",
      "lineIndex": 93
    },
    {
      "start": 329.04,
      "end": 333.173,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and worship the Father in his name, with pure hearts and clean hands,",
      "verse": "25:16",
      "lineIndex": 94
    },
    {
      "start": 333.353,
      "end": 336.604,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and look not forward any more for another Messiah,",
      "verse": "25:16",
      "lineIndex": 95
    },
    {
      "start": 336.784,
      "end": 339.292,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "then, at that time, the day will come",
      "verse": "25:16",
      "lineIndex": 96
    },
    {
      "start": 339.472,
      "end": 344.255,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "that it must needs be expedient that they should believe these things.",
      "verse": "25:16",
      "lineIndex": 97
    },
    {
      "start": 344.935,
      "end": 348.743,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And the Lord will set his hand again the second time",
      "verse": "25:17",
      "lineIndex": 98
    },
    {
      "start": 348.923,
      "end": 352.685,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "to restore his people from their lost and fallen state.",
      "verse": "25:17",
      "lineIndex": 99
    },
    {
      "start": 352.865,
      "end": 358.066,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Wherefore, he will proceed to do a marvelous work and a wonder among the children of men.",
      "verse": "25:17",
      "lineIndex": 100
    },
    {
      "start": 358.746,
      "end": 361.904,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Wherefore, he shall bring forth his words unto them,",
      "verse": "25:18",
      "lineIndex": 101
    },
    {
      "start": 362.084,
      "end": 365.103,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "which words shall judge them at the last day,",
      "verse": "25:18",
      "lineIndex": 102
    },
    {
      "start": 365.283,
      "end": 370.252,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "for they shall be given them for the purpose of convincing them of the true Messiah,",
      "verse": "25:18",
      "lineIndex": 103
    },
    {
      "start": 370.432,
      "end": 372.243,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "who was rejected by them;",
      "verse": "25:18",
      "lineIndex": 104
    },
    {
      "start": 372.423,
      "end": 374.699,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and unto the convincing of them",
      "verse": "25:18",
      "lineIndex": 105
    },
    {
      "start": 374.879,
      "end": 378.826,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "that they need not look forward any more for a Messiah to come,",
      "verse": "25:18",
      "lineIndex": 106
    },
    {
      "start": 379.006,
      "end": 380.956,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "for there should not any come,",
      "verse": "25:18",
      "lineIndex": 107
    },
    {
      "start": 381.136,
      "end": 383.504,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "save it should be a false Messiah",
      "verse": "25:18",
      "lineIndex": 108
    },
    {
      "start": 383.684,
      "end": 385.542,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "which should deceive the people;",
      "verse": "25:18",
      "lineIndex": 109
    },
    {
      "start": 385.722,
      "end": 389.251,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "for there is save one Messiah spoken of by the prophets,",
      "verse": "25:18",
      "lineIndex": 110
    },
    {
      "start": 389.431,
      "end": 392.821,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and that Messiah is he who should be rejected of the Jews.",
      "verse": "25:18",
      "lineIndex": 111
    },
    {
      "start": 393.501,
      "end": 396.38,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "For according to the words of the prophets,",
      "verse": "25:19",
      "lineIndex": 112
    },
    {
      "start": 396.56,
      "end": 401.204,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "the Messiah cometh in six hundred years from the time that my father left Jerusalem;",
      "verse": "25:19",
      "lineIndex": 113
    },
    {
      "start": 401.384,
      "end": 403.892,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and according to the words of the prophets,",
      "verse": "25:19",
      "lineIndex": 114
    },
    {
      "start": 404.072,
      "end": 406.858,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and also the word of the angel of God,",
      "verse": "25:19",
      "lineIndex": 115
    },
    {
      "start": 407.038,
      "end": 409.267,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "his name shall be Jesus Christ,",
      "verse": "25:19",
      "lineIndex": 116
    },
    {
      "start": 409.447,
      "end": 410.794,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "the Son of God.",
      "verse": "25:19",
      "lineIndex": 117
    },
    {
      "start": 411.474,
      "end": 412.774,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And now, my brethren,",
      "verse": "25:20",
      "lineIndex": 118
    },
    {
      "start": 412.954,
      "end": 415.555,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "I have spoken plainly that ye cannot err.",
      "verse": "25:20",
      "lineIndex": 119
    },
    {
      "start": 415.735,
      "end": 417.593,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And as the Lord God liveth",
      "verse": "25:20",
      "lineIndex": 120
    },
    {
      "start": 417.773,
      "end": 421.024,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "that brought Israel up out of the land of Egypt,",
      "verse": "25:20",
      "lineIndex": 121
    },
    {
      "start": 421.204,
      "end": 424.966,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and gave unto Moses power that he should heal the nations",
      "verse": "25:20",
      "lineIndex": 122
    },
    {
      "start": 425.146,
      "end": 428.304,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "after they had been bitten by the poisonous serpents,",
      "verse": "25:20",
      "lineIndex": 123
    },
    {
      "start": 428.484,
      "end": 432.013,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "if they would cast their eyes unto the serpent",
      "verse": "25:20",
      "lineIndex": 124
    },
    {
      "start": 432.193,
      "end": 434.701,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "which he did raise up before them,",
      "verse": "25:20",
      "lineIndex": 125
    },
    {
      "start": 434.881,
      "end": 437.946,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and also gave him power that he should smite the rock",
      "verse": "25:20",
      "lineIndex": 126
    },
    {
      "start": 438.126,
      "end": 440.448,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and the water should come forth;",
      "verse": "25:20",
      "lineIndex": 127
    },
    {
      "start": 440.628,
      "end": 442.578,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "yea, behold I say unto you",
      "verse": "25:20",
      "lineIndex": 128
    },
    {
      "start": 442.758,
      "end": 444.941,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "that as these things are true,",
      "verse": "25:20",
      "lineIndex": 129
    },
    {
      "start": 445.121,
      "end": 446.932,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and as the Lord God liveth,",
      "verse": "25:20",
      "lineIndex": 130
    },
    {
      "start": 447.112,
      "end": 449.991,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "there is none other name given under heaven",
      "verse": "25:20",
      "lineIndex": 131
    },
    {
      "start": 450.171,
      "end": 452.307,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "save it be this Jesus Christ,",
      "verse": "25:20",
      "lineIndex": 132
    },
    {
      "start": 452.487,
      "end": 454.205,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "of which I have spoken,",
      "verse": "25:20",
      "lineIndex": 133
    },
    {
      "start": 454.385,
      "end": 456.057,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "whereby man can be saved.",
      "verse": "25:20",
      "lineIndex": 134
    },
    {
      "start": 456.737,
      "end": 468.951,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Wherefore, for this cause hath the Lord God promised unto me that these things which I write shall be kept and preserved, and handed down unto my seed, from generation to generation,",
      "verse": "25:21",
      "lineIndex": 135
    },
    {
      "start": 469.131,
      "end": 472.428,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "that the promise may be fulfilled unto Joseph,",
      "verse": "25:21",
      "lineIndex": 136
    },
    {
      "start": 472.608,
      "end": 476.416,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "that his seed should never perish as long as the earth should stand.",
      "verse": "25:21",
      "lineIndex": 137
    },
    {
      "start": 477.096,
      "end": 481.461,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Wherefore, these things shall go from generation to generation",
      "verse": "25:22",
      "lineIndex": 138
    },
    {
      "start": 481.641,
      "end": 484.102,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "as long as the earth shall stand;",
      "verse": "25:22",
      "lineIndex": 139
    },
    {
      "start": 484.282,
      "end": 487.301,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and they shall go according to the will and pleasure of God;",
      "verse": "25:22",
      "lineIndex": 140
    },
    {
      "start": 487.481,
      "end": 493.425,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and the nations who shall possess them shall be judged of them according to the words which are written.",
      "verse": "25:22",
      "lineIndex": 141
    },
    {
      "start": 494.105,
      "end": 496.613,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "For we labor diligently to write,",
      "verse": "25:23",
      "lineIndex": 142
    },
    {
      "start": 496.793,
      "end": 498.465,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "to persuade our children,",
      "verse": "25:23",
      "lineIndex": 143
    },
    {
      "start": 498.645,
      "end": 500.363,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and also our brethren,",
      "verse": "25:23",
      "lineIndex": 144
    },
    {
      "start": 500.543,
      "end": 502.122,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "to believe in Christ,",
      "verse": "25:23",
      "lineIndex": 145
    },
    {
      "start": 502.302,
      "end": 504.299,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and to be reconciled to God;",
      "verse": "25:23",
      "lineIndex": 146
    },
    {
      "start": 504.479,
      "end": 507.637,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "for we know that it is by grace that we are saved,",
      "verse": "25:23",
      "lineIndex": 147
    },
    {
      "start": 507.817,
      "end": 509.442,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "after all we can do.",
      "verse": "25:23",
      "lineIndex": 148
    },
    {
      "start": 510.122,
      "end": 512.676,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And, notwithstanding we believe in Christ,",
      "verse": "25:24",
      "lineIndex": 149
    },
    {
      "start": 512.856,
      "end": 514.714,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "we keep the law of Moses,",
      "verse": "25:24",
      "lineIndex": 150
    },
    {
      "start": 514.894,
      "end": 517.82,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and look forward with steadfastness unto Christ,",
      "verse": "25:24",
      "lineIndex": 151
    },
    {
      "start": 518.0,
      "end": 519.997,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "until the law shall be fulfilled.",
      "verse": "25:24",
      "lineIndex": 152
    },
    {
      "start": 520.677,
      "end": 523.371,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "For, for this end was the law given;",
      "verse": "25:25",
      "lineIndex": 153
    },
    {
      "start": 523.551,
      "end": 526.291,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "wherefore the law hath become dead unto us,",
      "verse": "25:25",
      "lineIndex": 154
    },
    {
      "start": 526.471,
      "end": 529.908,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and we are made alive in Christ because of our faith;",
      "verse": "25:25",
      "lineIndex": 155
    },
    {
      "start": 530.088,
      "end": 532.921,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "yet we keep the law because of the commandments.",
      "verse": "25:25",
      "lineIndex": 156
    },
    {
      "start": 533.601,
      "end": 535.134,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And we talk of Christ,",
      "verse": "25:26",
      "lineIndex": 157
    },
    {
      "start": 535.314,
      "end": 536.847,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "we rejoice in Christ,",
      "verse": "25:26",
      "lineIndex": 158
    },
    {
      "start": 537.027,
      "end": 538.56,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "we preach of Christ,",
      "verse": "25:26",
      "lineIndex": 159
    },
    {
      "start": 538.74,
      "end": 540.412,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "we prophesy of Christ,",
      "verse": "25:26",
      "lineIndex": 160
    },
    {
      "start": 540.592,
      "end": 543.146,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and we write according to our prophecies,",
      "verse": "25:26",
      "lineIndex": 161
    },
    {
      "start": 543.326,
      "end": 546.623,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "that our children may know to what source they may look",
      "verse": "25:26",
      "lineIndex": 162
    },
    {
      "start": 546.803,
      "end": 549.032,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "for a remission of their sins.",
      "verse": "25:26",
      "lineIndex": 163
    },
    {
      "start": 549.712,
      "end": 552.173,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Wherefore, we speak concerning the law",
      "verse": "25:27",
      "lineIndex": 164
    },
    {
      "start": 552.353,
      "end": 555.232,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "that our children may know the deadness of the law;",
      "verse": "25:27",
      "lineIndex": 165
    },
    {
      "start": 555.412,
      "end": 558.431,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and they, by knowing the deadness of the law,",
      "verse": "25:27",
      "lineIndex": 166
    },
    {
      "start": 558.611,
      "end": 561.908,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "may look forward unto that life which is in Christ,",
      "verse": "25:27",
      "lineIndex": 167
    },
    {
      "start": 562.088,
      "end": 564.364,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and know for what end the law was given.",
      "verse": "25:27",
      "lineIndex": 168
    },
    {
      "start": 564.544,
      "end": 567.005,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And after the law is fulfilled in Christ,",
      "verse": "25:27",
      "lineIndex": 169
    },
    {
      "start": 567.185,
      "end": 570.064,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "that they need not harden their hearts against him",
      "verse": "25:27",
      "lineIndex": 170
    },
    {
      "start": 570.244,
      "end": 572.38,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "when the law ought to be done away.",
      "verse": "25:27",
      "lineIndex": 171
    },
    {
      "start": 573.06,
      "end": 576.311,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And now behold, my people, ye are a stiffnecked people;",
      "verse": "25:28",
      "lineIndex": 172
    },
    {
      "start": 576.491,
      "end": 579.37,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "wherefore, I have spoken plainly unto you,",
      "verse": "25:28",
      "lineIndex": 173
    },
    {
      "start": 579.55,
      "end": 581.408,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "that ye cannot misunderstand.",
      "verse": "25:28",
      "lineIndex": 174
    },
    {
      "start": 581.588,
      "end": 586.418,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And the words which I have spoken shall stand as a testimony against you;",
      "verse": "25:28",
      "lineIndex": 175
    },
    {
      "start": 586.598,
      "end": 590.035,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "for they are sufficient to teach any man the right way;",
      "verse": "25:28",
      "lineIndex": 176
    },
    {
      "start": 590.215,
      "end": 594.116,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "for the right way is to believe in Christ and deny him not;",
      "verse": "25:28",
      "lineIndex": 177
    },
    {
      "start": 594.296,
      "end": 597.5,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "for by denying him ye also deny the prophets and the law.",
      "verse": "25:28",
      "lineIndex": 178
    },
    {
      "start": 598.18,
      "end": 600.456,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And now behold, I say unto you",
      "verse": "25:29",
      "lineIndex": 179
    },
    {
      "start": 600.636,
      "end": 603.283,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "that the right way is to believe in Christ,",
      "verse": "25:29",
      "lineIndex": 180
    },
    {
      "start": 603.463,
      "end": 605.042,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and deny him not;",
      "verse": "25:29",
      "lineIndex": 181
    },
    {
      "start": 605.222,
      "end": 607.73,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and Christ is the Holy One of Israel;",
      "verse": "25:29",
      "lineIndex": 182
    },
    {
      "start": 607.91,
      "end": 610.278,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "wherefore ye must bow down before him,",
      "verse": "25:29",
      "lineIndex": 183
    },
    {
      "start": 610.458,
      "end": 613.755,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and worship him with all your might, mind and strength,",
      "verse": "25:29",
      "lineIndex": 184
    },
    {
      "start": 613.935,
      "end": 615.421,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and your whole soul;",
      "verse": "25:29",
      "lineIndex": 185
    },
    {
      "start": 615.601,
      "end": 619.084,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and if ye do this ye shall in nowise be cast out.",
      "verse": "25:29",
      "lineIndex": 186
    },
    {
      "start": 619.764,
      "end": 622.597,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And, inasmuch as it shall be expedient,",
      "verse": "25:30",
      "lineIndex": 187
    },
    {
      "start": 622.777,
      "end": 626.399,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "ye must keep the performances and ordinances of God",
      "verse": "25:30",
      "lineIndex": 188
    },
    {
      "start": 626.579,
      "end": 630.108,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "until the law shall be fulfilled which was given unto Moses.",
      "verse": "25:30",
      "lineIndex": 189
    }
  ]
}